  {
    "id": 1003002010010,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサーお疲れさまっ！\r\nねぇ、聞いて聞いて！",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "003",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100300201/1003002010010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002010020,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "今日ね、スタッフさんみんなから、\r\n『めぐるちゃん』って呼んでもらえたんだー！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300201/1003002010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、おう……そうか……\r\nよかったな……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002010030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うんっ！\r\nすっごく嬉しいよーっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300201/1003002010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも……それって、当り前じゃないのか……？\r\nいつもは違う……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002010040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あはは、ううん、そうじゃないの！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300201/1003002010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002010050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "前はね、すぐ名前が出なかったりして\r\n『そこの君』とか呼ばれることもあったから",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300201/1003002010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002010060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "今日のスタッフさんはみんな、\r\nわたしがめぐるだってわかっててくれたんだなーって思って！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300201/1003002010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002010070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "それに、『八宮さん』より仲良しな感じもするし！\r\nだからいつもよりもーっと嬉しいんだ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300201/1003002010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど、そういうことか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "前よりたくさんの人に覚えてもらえてるってことなら、\r\nめぐるが一生懸命アイドルをやっている成果だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最近はファンもどんどん増えてるし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002010080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへっ、だったらいいなー……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300201/1003002010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002010090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……あっ、でもでも、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300201/1003002010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002010100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサーはいっつも、わたしの力、みたいに言うけど\r\nプロデューサーの力も入れておかなきゃダメだからね！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300201/1003002010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002010110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……わたしひとりじゃ、\r\nきっとここまで進んでこれてなかったんだから",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300201/1003002010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002010120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "──わたしのことをね、\r\nもっとたくさんの人に知ってもらいたいの",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300201/1003002010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002010130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "見た目だけじゃなくて、歌だけじゃなくて、\r\nダンスだけじゃなくて──",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
